      "finding": "popularity (TopPop) matches SOTA RMSE-oriented algorithms under standard LOO (recall@10 ~0.29 vs AsySVD 0.28); correlation-based item-kNN performs extremely poorly under LOO; RMSE gains do not translate to top-N accuracy; test sets should exclude top-popular head items to avoid biasing toward non-personalized baselines."
